{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError"],"generated":true,"title":"Presenting in person","anchor":"Presenting-in-person"}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson"},"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Presenting in person","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Engagement is by QR code only. NFC engagement (a tap instead of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code) is in OID4VCgo’s Kotlin library, not this package: an iOS holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t answer a reader’s tap, and an iOS reader can’t tap a holder. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Android reader or holder that offers both still works with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package over the QR code."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both sides need "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. Bluetooth failures are "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s; protocol failures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Share as the holder","anchor":"Share-as-the-holder"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/qrCode","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show. It offers both "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityBLEMode","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s by default: it advertises"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the reader and scans for it at once, until a reader connects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either way (a reader offered both should connect in central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode). Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modes"},{"type":"text","text":" to offer one. It then reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/State-swift.enum\/requestReceived(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with who is asking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and what: ask the holder, then respond or decline."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ What the holder agreed to share: a requested document, the held","\/\/\/ mdoc to answer it with, and the elements to disclose.","struct InPersonAnswer {","    let document: Int","    let credentialID: String","    let elements: [MdocPresentation.Element]","}","","\/\/\/ Shares an mdoc in person. `showQRCode` displays the code; `consent`","\/\/\/ shows the reader's request and returns the holder's answer, or nil","\/\/\/ to decline. Returns whether the copy shared had been seen by another","\/\/\/ Verifier, or nil when nothing was shared.","func shareInPerson(wallet: Wallet, showQRCode: (String) -> Void,","                   consent: (ProximityPresentation.Request) async -> InPersonAnswer?) async throws -> Bool? {","    let session = try wallet.startProximityPresentation()","    showQRCode(session.qrCode)","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .requestReceived(let request):","            guard let answer = await consent(request) else {","                await session.decline()","                return nil","            }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            return try await session.respond(document: answer.document, credentialID: answer.credentialID,","                                             elements: answer.elements)","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on the consent screen. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader that signs its request (reader authentication) is named, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when its certificate chains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". An unsigned request could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"come from anyone who scanned the code. As over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from any other reader before the holder sees it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session at any point, as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder leaves the screen, say. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sets how long it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waits: by default 60 seconds for a reader to connect, 30 for its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request, and 300 for the holder to decide."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Read as the verifier","anchor":"Read-as-the-verifier"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" needs no "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": give it the IACAs whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mdocs it accepts, and, to sign its requests so holders see who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asking, a key in a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and its certificate chain, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader authentication extended key usage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). The reader is a production one: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"type":"text","text":") a configuration that leaves a decision open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which IACAs issue which document types ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anyIssuerForAnyType"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRootsByDocType"},{"type":"text","text":"), and each role’s revocation ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revocation"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"crls"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"noRevocationCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" to decline). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"type":"text","text":" relaxes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this, for trying out a development issuer’s documents; never ship an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app with it set. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the holder’s QR code and what to ask for."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Reads an mDL's name and portrait from the holder whose QR code was","\/\/\/ scanned. Returns the verified mdoc, or nil if the holder declined or","\/\/\/ the mdoc isn't known to be unrevoked.","func readInPerson(qrCode: String, issuerRoots: String, crls: String) async throws -> VerifiedMdoc? {","    let reader = try ProximityReader(configuration: ProximityReaderConfiguration(","        issuerRoots: issuerRoots, crls: crls, revocation: [.issuer, .status],","        anyIssuerForAnyType: true))","    let session = try reader.start(qrCode: qrCode, docType: \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\",","                                   elements: [\"org.iso.18013.5.1\": [\"given_name\", \"family_name\", \"portrait\"]])","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .verified(let mdoc):","            let status = try await session.checkStatus()","            return status == .valid || status == .noStatus ? mdoc : nil","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" carries the disclosed elements, the document signer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the IACA it chains to, and its validity. Decide which issuers to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accept on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuerChain","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the verified certificate path:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/trustAnchor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are names any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document signer under a trusted IACA can choose, for display."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session doesn’t check revocation itself:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does, once the session is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".verified"},{"type":"text","text":". It fetches the issuer’s status list over the network, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the reader needs a connection then, and verifies the list is signed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under the certificate the document names or the CA that signed the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document signer (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §12.3.6). Rely on the document only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/valid","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocStatus/noStatus":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocstatus\/nostatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The MSO names no revocation list."}],"title":"MdocStatus.noStatus","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityBLEMode":{"title":"ProximityBLEMode","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityBLEMode"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityblemode","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityBLEMode"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityBLEMode","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The BLE roles a holder offers in its QR code (ISO\/IEC 18013-5"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"§8.3.3.1.1); the reader picks one, central client mode when offered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityTimeouts":{"title":"ProximityTimeouts","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityTimeouts"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitytimeouts","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityTimeouts"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long an in-person session waits (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 recommends at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"least 30 seconds from engagement to the request, §8.2.3, and 300"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"seconds of inactivity before ending a session, §9.1.1.4)."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"title":"Wallet","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityPresentation/cancel()":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitypresentation\/cancel()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ends the session now, from any state."}],"title":"cancel()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/VerifiedMdoc/issuer":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/verifiedmdoc\/issuer","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The document signer certificate’s subject common name, for display:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any document signer under a trusted IACA can choose it, so decide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerChain"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"issuer","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"issuer"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuer","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store (the Secure Enclave). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":" WalletError."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"title":"KeyStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError":{"title":"WalletError","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An error from OID4VCgo: a stable "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code"},{"type":"text","text":", the issuer’s, Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Server’s or Verifier’s own error code when it gave one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"protocolError"},{"type":"text","text":"), and a message for logs: it never carries personal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, a remote party’s own description, a URL’s path or query, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control characters. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localizedDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sentence fit to show the holder; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isRetryable"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether trying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same step again may succeed."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRoots":{"title":"mdocReaderRoots","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mdocReaderRoots","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderroots","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PEM certificates: the mdoc readers recognized when one signs an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" request ("},{"code":"MdocPresentation.Request.reader","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). Empty:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every such request is shown by its origin."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityPresentation":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitypresentation","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The holder’s side of an ISO\/IEC 18013-5 in-person presentation over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"BLE: show "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"qrCode"},{"type":"text","text":", and the reader that scans it connects, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"advertises for the holder to connect, in one of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProximityBLEMode"},{"type":"text","text":"s the session offers. Follow "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"states"},{"type":"text","text":": on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".requestReceived"},{"type":"text","text":", ask"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"respond"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"decline"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cancel"},{"type":"text","text":" ends it at any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point. One request per session. The app’s Info.plist needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityPresentation"}],"title":"ProximityPresentation","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityPresentation"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReaderIdentity":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreaderidentity","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Who sent a request, as the holder sees it."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityReaderIdentity"}],"title":"ProximityReaderIdentity","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityReaderIdentity"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReader/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreader\/start(qrcode:doctype:elements:timeouts:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads the holder’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"qrCode"},{"type":"text","text":" and starts a session asking for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"docType"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"elements"},{"type":"text","text":" (namespace → identifiers): it scans for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder, or advertises for it, as the holder’s QR code offers. A QR"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code it can’t use is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidInput"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"start","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"qrCode","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"docType","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"elements","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":" : [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeouts","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityTimeouts","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17ProximityTimeoutsV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityReaderSession","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet22ProximityReaderSessionC"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/VerifiedMdoc":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/verifiedmdoc","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A verified mdoc, as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProximityReaderSession"},{"type":"text","text":" received it."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"VerifiedMdoc"}],"title":"VerifiedMd